sequenceDiagram
    participant DF as Data Fetcher
    participant DL as Data Loader
    participant S as Service
    participant R as Repository

    DF->>DL: load(keys)
    DL->>S: batch request
    S->>R: query by keys
    R-->>S: results
    S-->>DL: mapped results
    DL-->>DF: ordered response
